            "reply_to": "M1",
            "text": "Thanks. I've reviewed the objectives and started on T1, mapping the current processes. The draft operating model is in A1. To move forward on T2, we need to define the initial scope. I suggest we start with the 'City Center' and 'South Heights' buildings. They represent our two main property types and have reliable data.",
