            "speaker_id": 128593,
            "reply_to": "M14",
            "text": "Thanks for sharing. I've had a look at A2. It's a good start, but we need to add a section for signing the regulatory addenda, especially for energy performance certificates. This is critical for T4 and the main rental agreement A3.",
            "mentions": [
              52814
