            "artifact_refs": [
              "A2",
              "T4",
              "A3"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M16",
            "speaker_id": 48703,
            "reply_to": "M15",
            "text": "Good catch, @128593. We also need to add steps for documenting the initial condition with photos, meter readings, and key handover confirmation. This will protect us from disputes later. I've added these suggestions directly into the A2 document.",
