            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M18",
            "speaker_id": 48703,
            "reply_to": "M17",
            "text": "No problem. The goal is to have one comprehensive checklist for the entire onboarding. I also think we should link the tenant-facing FAQ from T9 in the welcome email template. @52814 can you draft that FAQ?",
            "mentions": [
