      {
        "thread_id": "TH4",
        "thread_goal": "Agree on KPIs, dashboard structure and reporting cadence.",
        "messages": [
          {
            "msg_id": "M38",
            "speaker_id": 52814,
            "reply_to": null,
            "text": "Hello, as part of T7 I've created the first version of the property performance dashboard template. It's in A6. I've added columns for occupancy and rent collected.",
            "mentions": [
              48703,
              54175
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T7",
              "A6"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M39",
            "speaker_id": 48703,
            "reply_to": "M38",
            "text": "Thanks for starting this. Occupancy and arrears are key, but we also need operational metrics to see the full picture. I suggest we add: number of open maintenance issues, average issue resolution time, and status of mandatory compliance checks (from T12). This will help us be proactive.",
            "mentions": [
              52814
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T12"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "chart_with_upwards_trend",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M40",
            "speaker_id": 54175,
            "reply_to": "M39",
            "text": "We need a top-line financial metric too. Something like Net Operating Income. Can we add that?",
            "mentions": [
              48703
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M41",
            "speaker_id": 48703,
            "reply_to": "M40",
            "text": "We can certainly add Net Operating Income. The finance team will need to provide the inputs for that calculation. I'll add it as a placeholder and coordinate with them. So, the proposed KPI set is: Occupancy Rate, Rent Arrears, Open Maintenance Issues, Avg. Resolution Time, Compliance Check Status, and NOI. Does this set work for everyone?",
            "mentions": [
              54175,
              52814,
              128593
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A6"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D7"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M42",
            "speaker_id": 128593,
            "reply_to": "M41",
            "text": "This looks like a robust set of KPIs. It balances leading and lagging indicators well.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": [
              {
                "emoji": "+1",
                "count": 1
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M43",
            "speaker_id": 52814,
            "reply_to": "M41",
            "text": "Ok I will add these to the dashboard A6.",
            "mentions": [
              48703
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "A6"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M44",
            "speaker_id": 54175,
            "reply_to": "M41",
            "text": "Yes, this is the right set of metrics. Approved.",
            "mentions": [],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M45",
            "speaker_id": 48703,
            "reply_to": "M44",
            "text": "Great, D7 is confirmed. Now for the reporting cadence. How often should we share this with stakeholders? I propose a weekly internal review for our team, and a monthly summary report for senior management and property owners, as part of the T8 communication pack.",
            "mentions": [
              54175
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [
              "T8"
            ],
            "decision_refs": [
              "D8"
            ],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M46",
            "speaker_id": 54175,
            "reply_to": "M45",
            "text": "Monthly for owners and management is appropriate. I want to see the weekly internal version as well.",
            "mentions": [
              48703
            ],
            "artifact_refs": [],
            "decision_refs": [],
            "reactions": []
          },
          {
            "msg_id": "M47",
            "speaker_id": 48703,
            "reply_to": "M46",
            "text": "Understood. So we'll proceed with a weekly internal dashboard review and a monthly summary for external stakeholders. Decision D8 is confirmed. @52814, please update A6 with the final KPIs and add a note about the reporting cadence.",
